        <headline>Special Weather Statement issued September 25 at 5:57AM CDT by NWS North Platte NE</headline>
        <description>Fog, locally dense, will occur this morning across the area. Be
prepared for rapid fluctuations in visibility. If traveling, be
prepared for hazardous driving conditions due to low visibility.
Visibility should improve by mid-morning.
</description>
